{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d86068e759cf22b9","name":"Rogue Shadow","source":{"id":"source:reference-d86068e759cf22b9","title":"Rogue Shadow","revision":19563,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:11:50Z","sha256":"f68c93d254a13a2c6d1e3fb580032287db8862c10665f933b75e96b9bb6d771c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19563","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rogue%20Shadow&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d86068e759cf22b9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The personal transport of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galen Marek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galen_Marek","referenceId":"reference:fab99915522f39b3"},", ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," is a one-of-a-kind vessel designed to transport Vader's agent covertly throughout the galaxy. Though the vessel has had a long string of unsuccessful pilots, the transport is among one of the most sophisticated vessels in the galaxy. Having come across the schematics for Darth Maul's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Infiltrator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Infiltrator","referenceId":"reference:24ccf9efbbe86cd8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"}," commissioned a similar vessel from Sienar Fleet Systems.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Infiltrator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Infiltrator","referenceId":"reference:24ccf9efbbe86cd8"},", only a single prototype of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," was built before it was turned over to Vader and his apprentice. All the engineers and mechanics who knew of the project were killed to ensure their silence, and following its completion only a small number of people knew of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow's"]}," existence.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The vessel is reminiscent of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Infiltrator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Infiltrator","referenceId":"reference:24ccf9efbbe86cd8"}," both in form and capabilities. Heavily armed and boasting an advanced ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stygian Cloaking Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stygian_Cloaking_Device?action=edit&redlink=1"}," (granting the ship ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," when activated), ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," is capable of moving throughout the stars undetected. The ship is considerably faster and more maneuverable than others of its size, and its shields are nearly unparalleled. ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," also has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Enhancement Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Enhancement_Package","referenceId":"reference:b8f9ecb747f86165"}," (granting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Sensors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Sensors","referenceId":"reference:1bf2e88f5409e504"},") and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," that moves the ship across the galaxy at speeds unheard of for a nonmilitary vessel. All of this impressive equipment is housed in a rather nondescript shell; Vader commanded that the ship be given a ubiquitous appearance, and as such ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," is a powerful combat vessel hiding beneath the looks of a civilian personal transport.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Ace)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Rogue Shadow"]}," Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal* ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +17\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["*This ship is treated as a Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," for the purposes of being targeted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," weapons, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfighting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfighting"},", and using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"},"."]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag"